text Route104_Text_TrainerTipsDoubleBattles {
    format("TRAINER TIPS\p In the HOENN region there are pairs of TRAINERS who challenge others\l for 2-on-2 POKéMON battles called\l DOUBLE BATTLES.\p In a DOUBLE BATTLE, the TRAINER must send out two POKéMON, the one at the\l left of the list and the top one.\l Watch how POKéMON are lined up.")
}

